pply</div></div> </div> </div> <div class="col-6-md t--fadedown"> <div class="item"> <a href="https://www.safer-ai.org/jobs/frontier-ai-risk-management-research-engineer"></a> <div class="top mh" data-mh="item"> <div class="logo"><img src="https://www.safer-ai.org/t/assets/img/symbol.svg"/></div> <div class="title">Frontier AI Risk Management — Research Engineer</div> <div class="excerpt">                   SaferAI is hiring for a Research Engineer role on its Frontier AI Risk Management (FAIRM) team. This role offers a direct opportunity to shape how the world\'s leading AI companies manage risk at a pivotal moment.                </div> </div> <div class="cta"><div class="btn">apply</div></div> </div> </div> <div class="col-6-md t--fadedown"> <div class="item"> <a href="https://www.safer-ai.org/jobs/policy-associate"></a> <div class="top mh" data-mh="item"> <div class="logo"><img src="https://www.safer-ai.org/t/assets/img/symbol.svg"/></div> <div class="title">Policy Associate</div> <div class="excerpt">                   SaferAI is seeking a Policy Associate with a strong ability to engage and coordinate multiple stakeholders, including policymakers and scientists.                </div> </div> <div class="cta"><div class="btn">apply</div></div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </section>\n<!-- LAYOUT:FOOTER -->\n</main>'}], 'model': 'claude-haiku-4-5'}}
