2026-04-20 10:52:43,284 [DEBUG] anthropic._base_client: Request options: {'method': 'post', 'url': '/v1/messages', 'timeout': Timeout(connect=5.0, read=600, write=600, pool=600), 'files': None, 'idempotency_key': 'stainless-python-retry-c5d4e3a5-2d62-47cf-885c-cb2a018fc69b', 'content': None, 'json_data': {'max_tokens': 4096, 'messages': [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Extract all job/position listings from this career page HTML.\nReturn a JSON array where each element has:\n- "title": job title string\n- "url": full URL to the job posting (resolve relative URLs against https://metr.org/careers)\n- "location": location if mentioned, else null\n- "role_type": "Full-time", "Part-time", "Fellowship", "Internship", or null\n\nOnly include actual job openings, internships, and fellowships.\nIgnore navigation links, news articles, blog posts, event listings, etc.\nIf there are no job listings on the page, return an empty array: []\nReturn ONLY valid JSON, no other text.\n\n---\n\n<div class="section section-content section-open-roles full-bleed">\n<div class="container-xxl metr-gutter">\n<div class="left-title-section">\n<div class="mr-1">\n<h2 id="open-roles">Open roles</h2>\n<p>Join us in building scientific methods to assess AI capabilities, risks and mitigations.</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div class="role-cards-grid">\n<a class="role-card" href="https://jobs.lever.co/metr/1c044574-181d-4b3d-98de-27f12eb76c6f">\n<div class="badge badge-engineering">Engineering &amp; Research</div>\n<h3 class="role-title">Member of Technical Staff, Research</h3>\n<p class="role-meta">\n    Berkeley, CA • On-site • <span class="nowrap">$258K–341K</span>\n</p>\n</a>\n<a class="role-card" href="https://jobs.lever.co/metr/3d81cd86-31ae-498a-aa55-c31e0c532b07">\n<div class="badge badge-engineering">Engineering &amp; Research</div>\n<h3 class="role-title">Cloud Evals Infrastructure Engineer</h3>\n<p class="role-meta">\n    Berkeley, CA • On-site • <span class="nowrap">$258K–341K</span>\n</p>\n</a>\n<a class="role-card" href="https://jobs.lever.co/metr/1906a024-9bb0-4175-b74a-224dd96fafea">\n<div class="badge badge-operations">Operations</div>\n<h3 class="role-title">Director of Operations</h3>\n<p class="role-meta">\n    Berkeley, CA • On-site • <span class="nowrap">$296K–341K</span>\n</p>\n</a>\n<a class="role-card" href="https://jobs.lever.co/metr/f3a6db11-7fd1-48e4-af42-20aad1ded72d">\n<div class="badge badge-general">General Interest</div>\n<h3 class="role-title">General Expression of Interest</h3>\n<p class="role-meta">\n    Berkeley, CA • Flexible\n  </p>\n</a>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>'}], 'model': 'claude-haiku-4-5'}}
